  "title": "Evidence evaluation file",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Evidence evaluation file</h2><p>Select the appropriate follow-up for four audit-evidence matters.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f1\">Follow-up for the nonresponse</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Perform suitable alternative procedures\">Perform suitable alternative procedures</option><option value=\"Treat silence as agreement\">Treat silence as agreement</option><option value=\"Accept a controller signature\">Accept a controller signature</option><option value=\"Ignore the selected item\">Ignore the selected item</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f2\">Follow-up for the forwarded response</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"Authenticate source and transmission\">Authenticate source and transmission</option><option value=\"Assume independence\">Assume independence</option><option value=\"Reject every electronic response\">Reject every electronic response</option><option value=\"Ignore the source\">Ignore the source</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f3\">Assertion implicated by the consignment</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Rights and obligations\">Rights and obligations</option><option value=\"Only audit timing\">Only audit timing</option><option value=\"No assertion\">No assertion</option><option value=\"Only depreciation\">Only depreciation</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f4\">Follow-up for old bank transfers</label><select id=\"aud-m3-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Investigate and support the reconciling items\">Investigate and support the reconciling items</option><option value=\"Rely only on the confirmed bank balance\">Rely only on the confirmed bank balance</option><option value=\"Remove the reconciliation from the file\">Remove the reconciliation from the file</option><option value=\"Assume all transfers are immaterial\">Assume all transfers are immaterial</option></select></div></section>",
